/* ============================================================
   SURTAX_ORDERS — every currently active Canadian surtax-imposing
   Order in Council, pulled from the consolidated text on
   laws-lois.justice.gc.ca (NOT the remission side — remission/
   exclusion schedules like Schedule 6 of SOR/2025-122 are
   deliberately NOT included here, since they grant relief FROM
   surtax rather than establishing that it applies).
   Pulled and transcribed 28 JUL 2026.
   Fields:
     regNo     — the SOR number
     name      — official order name
     url       — link to consolidated text
     rate      — surtax %, or "TRQ" for tariff-rate-quota orders
     rateNote  — human-readable rate description
     origin    — which imports this applies to
     type      — "flat" (always applies to listed codes+origin) or
                 "trq" (only applies above a quarterly import quota —
                 cannot be answered yes/no without checking current
                 quota data, so treat any match here as "check GAC/
                 CBSA quota status", not a confirmed hit)
     hsCodes   — tariff items from the order's schedule(s)
   ============================================================ */
