// Ch.30, user-provided markdown, full read) =====
// Free-by-default chapter (added to MFN_FREE_DEFAULT_CHAPTERS), 5 confirmed
// exceptions, all clustered in heading 30.06 (gel preparations 'other' and
// the placebo/clinical-trial-kit group by base — syrup/sugar/other-food/
// beverage). No gaps this chapter — every code resolved to either confirmed
// Free or a specific rate, so the free-by-default fallback is safe here
