// ===== Chapter 87 - Vehicles Other Than Railway or Tramway Rolling-Stock,
// and Parts and Accessories Thereof (verified 11 AUG 2026 from CBSA Ch.87,
// user-provided markdown, 2,262-line source, full read) =====
// Free-by-default (added to MFN_FREE_DEFAULT_CHAPTERS) - 196 of 291 codes
// dutiable (67%), a genuinely dutiable-majority chapter reflecting how
// commercially significant motor vehicles and parts are. One pre-existing
// stray code (8703.22.00.12) independently confirmed correct against this
// source.
// Key patterns worth remembering:
// - Heading 87.02 (buses) has a genuine 3-way split throughout: GPT
//   excluded (6%), CPTPT ALSO excluded with its own separate 1.1% rate -
//   distinct from 87.03 (cars) and most of 87.04 (trucks) where CPTPT gets
//   full relief and only GPT is excluded.
// - Three specific 87.03 codes (8703.22/23/24, by engine cylinder capacity)
//   give AUT/NZT full relief rather than the partial/no relief seen
//   elsewhere in the same heading.
// - Heading 87.08 (parts and accessories) - by far the largest heading in
//   the chapter - runs on one highly consistent, repeated pattern across
//   nearly every part category (bumpers, brakes, gear boxes, drive-axles,
//   wheels, suspension, radiators, mufflers, clutches, steering, airbags,
//   power train parts): parts specifically for farm tractors (by exact
//   tariff item), veterinary-equipped vehicles, or fire-fighting vehicle
//   manufacture are Free, while the equivalent general-purpose 'Other' part
//   in the same subheading is dutiable at 6%.
// - Motorcycles (87.11) are 100% Free; bicycles (87.12) are dutiable at a
//   flat 13% MFN with real GPT relief to 8.5% - a sharp contrast between
//   two adjacent two-wheeled-vehicle headings.
// - Two 'impossible' extraction artifacts (a preferential rate lower than a
//   Free MFN rate) were treated as bleed-over noise from adjacent dutiable
//   codes, not real provisions - matching the established practice
//   throughout this build.
const CH87_FREE_DEFAULT = ["87"];
